block.innerContent after createBlock (see createBlock, innerContent,
insertBlocks), but insertBlocks uses the block's attributes (e.g.,
attributes.content for core/paragraph) so innerContent will be ignored; either
remove the innerHTML parameter from the API/schema and stop assigning
